          "type": "callout",
          "style": "takeaway",
          "title": "Key Takeaways",
          "text": "WITH names a subquery so it reads top to bottom. Chain CTEs by reading earlier ones. WITH RECURSIVE = anchor + UNION ALL + a stop condition. A CTE can feed DELETE ... RETURNING."
